WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.072
It was Yoo Jin's first day at school.

2
00:00:09.073 --> 00:00:14.176
Yoo Jin's mom kissed her cheek and patted her head.

3
00:00:14.177 --> 00:00:17.538
"Don't be scared, sweetheart," Mom said.

4
00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:33.274
"School is fun."

5
00:00:33.275 --> 00:00:35.788
Yoo Jin held her new bag.

6
00:00:35.789 --> 00:00:42.395
She had new pencils, books, and erasers.

7
00:00:42.396 --> 00:00:51.669
Yoo Jin was happy and scared.

8
00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.245
Yoo Jin saw the big girls.

9
00:00:54.246 --> 00:00:57.029
They were on the swings.

10
00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:01.025
They were on the seesaw.

11
00:01:01.026 --> 00:01:02.982
The girls skipped.

12
00:01:02.983 --> 00:01:07.209
They sang, "Dance, laugh, and learn too.

13
00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.518
Come and play!

14
00:01:08.519 --> 00:01:15.482
Don't be blue!"

15
00:01:15.483 --> 00:01:19.865
Yoo Jin ran to the girls.

16
00:01:19.866 --> 00:01:23.409
She sat on the seesaw.

17
00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:27.638
She got on the swing.

18
00:01:27.639 --> 00:01:31.195
Yoo Jin skipped.

19
00:01:31.196 --> 00:01:35.603
Yoo Jin sang, "Dance, laugh, and learn too.

20
00:01:35.604 --> 00:01:37.025
Come and play.

21
00:01:37.026 --> 00:01:39.863
Don't be blue!"

22
00:01:39.864 --> 00:01:43.287
It was Yoo Jin's first day of school.

23
00:01:43.288 --> 00:01:48.785
She loved it.

